ZOQtYn5umbQNKMME9gqhBERIn4OkHznqdXCE73WKGSgMAqYE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTQnoP_6Pokm7r7aUkO6VKlJKdbWuLWvOJUl7tG2gxMYQ&oe=6AF1F8AA"}, {"file_name": "unnamed (1).png", "id": "1871544307483939", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824741_1871544314150605_3898985176196315410_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=c3AnV1qGk2EQ7kNvwFSubfC&_nc_oc=Ado7_U_IptHf112WUySAxaxhfk1o5wbdCGuL52yfn-pa_WsPINqqLviqpzG6NI83C5o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTNV0lDhbtC7kXB0kHqb9AHzvKUjLrXq6nyousl339Q4g&oe=6AF1EB4F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "DOWN", "keywords": ["descent", "falling", "synthwave", "arcade", "dodge"], "long_description": "DOWN is a fast, physical VR descent through a neon city suspended in the void.\n\nStand on a floating platform, read the incoming patterns, and move into the safe space before the next wave erupts. Survive three escalating rounds, launch onto high-speed slides, thread the barriers, and carry the run all the way to the finish gate.\n\nFeatures:\n- Short, replayable runs built around quick reactions and real-world movement\n- Three dodge rounds, two steep neon slides, and a final 220-metre victory drop\n- A pulsing synthwave soundtrack with unlockable tracks\n- Live altitude and route feedback throughout the descent\n- Finish-line graffiti: leave your name behind when you survive\n\nDOWN supports Touch controllers and hand tracking. Play standing or room-scale in a clear 2 m \u00d7 2 m area. The experience uses intense artificial motion and is best suited to players comfortable with high-speed VR.", "short_description": "Step off a neon skyline and commit to the drop. Dodge rising hazards, carve through high-speed slides, and survive three escalating stages in a replayable room-scale VR descent."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://playdownvr.web.app/privacy.html"